=== introduction ===
You regained consciousness a few days ago
You were found by a young lady who helped and sheltered youYou found yourself in a world you didn’t know
Eloise, this young lady, explained everything about this world to you
So, you decide to go on a journey to discover the world and try to recover the memory you lost and to find out how you ended up here
